# A1/04_food.letz

@lesson A1.04 "Food and Drinks"

@word d'Waasser = water
@word de Kaffi = coffee
@word den Téi = tea
@word d'Mëllech = milk
@word d'Brout = bread
@word de Kéis = cheese
@word d'Fleesch = meat
@word de Fësch = fish
@word d'Uebst = fruit
@word d'Geméis = vegetables
@word den Äppel = apple
@word d'Banann = banana
@word d'Kartoffel = potato
@word de Zalot = salad
@word d'Zopp = soup
@word de Räis = rice
@word d'Nuddelen = noodles
@word d'Botter = butter
@word d'Ee = egg
@word den Zocker = sugar

@sentence
@lu Ech hätt gär e Kaffi, w.e.g.
@en I would like a coffee, please.
@distractor-en tea
@distractor-en water
@distractor-lu Téi
@distractor-lu Waasser

@sentence
@lu D'Zopp ass gutt.
@en The soup is good.
@distractor-en bad
@distractor-en bread
@distractor-lu schlecht
@distractor-lu Brout

@sentence
@lu Mir iessen Brout a Kéis.
@en We eat bread and cheese.
@distractor-en drink
@distractor-en meat
@distractor-lu drénken
@distractor-lu Fleesch
